{"subject":"New Position Email - JC 1341 Senior Network Engineer","from":"Erin Cowder <Erin.Cowder@tidalhealth.org>","received":"2026-07-20T16:30:22Z","category":"New Position","id":"AAMkADk1MWNmNjlkLWUwNDMtNDA1YS1hNWE1LWM4NjcyZWNmMjI3MgBGAAAAAACVY1g7tYBDQrblouFwBAEZBwBuBgY699yeSZ3FxYmVftSLAABM5NAqAABuBgY699yeSZ3FxYmVftSLAABM5QBJAAA=","imid":"<LV9PR01MB9942001E696913BA8F69A28B75F0C32@LV9PR01MB994200.prod.exchangelabs.com>","body":"<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\"><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Wingdings}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:\"Cambria Math\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Calibri}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Aptos}\r\np.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n\t{margin:0in;\r\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\r\n\tfont-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\np.MsoListParagraph, li.MsoListParagraph, div.MsoListParagraph\r\n\t{margin-top:0in;\r\n\tmargin-right:0in;\r\n\tmargin-bottom:0in;\r\n\tmargin-left:.5in;\r\n\tfont-size:11.0pt;\r\n\tfont-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\nspan.EmailStyle17\r\n\t{font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\r\n\tcolor:windowtext}\r\n.MsoChpDefault\r\n\t{}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n\t{margin:1.0in 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n\t{}\r\nol\r\n\t{margin-bottom:0in}\r\nul\r\n\t{margin-bottom:0in}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#467886\" vlink=\"#96607D\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Hello team!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">A new position has been created and approved to be filled. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Please see position info below. <a id=\"OWAAMA4D43A43D5C5480DA78C9DA81D1F26B6\" href=\"mailto:Mark.Weisman@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Mark Weisman</span></a> if there are any more changes to the position description information listed below, please let us know so we can adjust prior to posting. Specifically, if you could confirm the &nbsp;work schedule of the role as that was not listed in any communication I received.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a id=\"OWAAM7BF7D2EEA6AB483DAE65E25C47CB457F\" href=\"mailto:Gina.Vieira@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Gina Vieira</span></a> please let Mark know next steps for the position in terms of posting and filling. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Please let us know if there are any questions, we are happy to help</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Title: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Senior Network Engineer</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">PL/CC/JC</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">PL 13 / CC 9360 / JC 1341</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:16.55pt\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Grade: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">32</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Salary Range:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">$100,547.20 (48.34/hr) - $155,833.60 ($74.92/hr)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">FLSA: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Exempt (salaried)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">License: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">FTE Leader:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">N</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">FTE Hours:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">1.00</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Reports to:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Network/Client Support Manager</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"> </span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Position Summary:</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The Senior Network Engineer is responsible for the design, implementation, optimization, and operational support of a large-scale, highly available healthcare network spanning multiple hospitals, ambulatory sites, and data centers. This role supports a mission-critical environment with approximately 30,000 networked devices across 3 hospitals and 90 ambulatory sites within a 90-mile radius. The engineer will provide expert-level support for routed and switched networks, data center infrastructure, WAN connectivity, wireless systems, firewalls, and unified communications, ensuring high availability, security, and performance in a regulated healthcare setting.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or equivalent experience.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">License and/or certification:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0in\">Cisco certifications such as CCNP, CCIE, or equivalent preferred.</li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Seven (7) years of progressive experience in enterprise network engineering.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Extensive hands-on experience with Cisco networking technologies in large environments.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Expertise in routing and switching, including BGP, OSPF, and EIGRP.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience supporting large-scale WANs and multi-site healthcare or similarly regulated environments.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience with Cisco data center products (e.g. Nexus, Cisco ACI) preferred.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Cloud networking (e.g. AWS, Azure) preferred.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience with security products, especially firewalls preferred.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience in healthcare IT environments preferred.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Familiarity with network automation, monitoring tools, and ITIL practices preferred.</li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Evenings and weekends may be required as needed.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thanks,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder, SHRM-CP</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Human Resources Department</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>tidalhealth.org</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Have a question for HR?&nbsp; Send it to our Shared Services team.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-c804-4afa-93c3-f7308ddcbdae?tenantId=ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8&amp;hint=384e5157-8ea1-4b5c-912b-4a3979a7f5f3&amp;source=sharebutton&amp;sourcetime=1769439969989\">HR Questions &amp; Answers</a></span><i></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}